Z||000006||turbo86se||08-07-2000||12:03 AM||||how about when I come into town I let you drive the Fiero while I'm there?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  LOL<P>Well, I may keep my interior grey, I camme across a 86SE V6 in a junkyard and got a mint dash, extra guages, and a set of excellent condition GT seat covers from a forum member. I'm also playing with the idea of painting the rear interior trim pieces red. I think that may look exotic, especially if I repaint the car factory red.<P>How much would you like to get for the fastback section?  My grandmother is hanging in there, so hopefully my trip to MD won't be anytime soon, except for my sister's wedding next month!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ||||reg||1
